<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: moa egg (fert.) -->
  <AEXP_EggMoaFertilized.label>恐鳥蛋（已受精）</AEXP_EggMoaFertilized.label>
  <!-- EN: A fertilized moa egg. If all goes well, it should hatch into a baby moa. It can be eaten raw, but it's much better cooked. -->
  <AEXP_EggMoaFertilized.description>已受精的恐鳥蛋。如果一切順利應該可以孵化出恐鳥仔。可以生吃，但是最好烹飪後食用。</AEXP_EggMoaFertilized.description>
  
  <!-- EN: moa egg (unfert.) -->
  <AEXP_EggMoaUnfertilized.label>恐鳥蛋（未受精）</AEXP_EggMoaUnfertilized.label>
  <!-- EN: An unfertilized moa egg. It can be eaten raw, but it's much better cooked. -->
  <AEXP_EggMoaUnfertilized.description>未受精的恐鳥蛋。可以生吃，但是最好烹飪後食用。</AEXP_EggMoaUnfertilized.description>
  
